      "descriptionHtml": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Soft mixed-media dress fabric with a smooth black bodice and blush pink tulle skirt; exact fiber composition was not visible in the supplied evidence.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A sweet mom-and-daughter look for birthdays, portraits, summer outings, and everyday twirling.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Color reference:</strong> Blush Tulle pairs a black sleeveless top with a pale pink layered skirt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Choose the baby romper, girl dress, or mother dress by Type, all in the same coordinated color story.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Hand wash cold or machine wash gentle in a garment bag, line dry, and steam tulle lightly if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Baby 0-3M to 12-18M, girls Child 1-2 Years to Child 9-10 Years, and Mother S to Mother 4XL.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Baby Romper</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n<thead><tr>\n<th>Size</th>\n<th>Age</th>\n<th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n<th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Sleeve or Skirt (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n<th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Baby 0-3 Months</td>\n<td>0-3M</td>\n<td>4-7 kg / 8.8-15.4 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>23 cm / 9.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0 in</td>\n<td>52 cm / 20.5 in</td>\n<td>41 cm / 16.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baby 6-9 Months</td>\n<td>6-9M</td>\n<td>6.5-8.5 kg / 14.3-18.7 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>25 cm / 9.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>58 cm / 22.8 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>43 cm / 16.9 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baby 9-12 Months</td>\n<td>9-12M</td>\n<td>9-10 kg / 19.8-22.0 lbs</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0 in</td>\n<td>27 cm / 10.6 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>60 cm / 23.6 in</td>\n<td>56 cm / 22.0 in</td>\n<td>45 cm / 17.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Baby 1