td>120-130 cm / 47.2-51.2 in</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>79 cm / 31.1 in</td>\n<td>51 cm / 20.1 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 8 Years</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>26.5-31 kg / 58.4-68.3 lbs</td>\n<td>130-140 cm / 51.2-55.1 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85 cm / 33.5 in</td>\n<td>81 cm / 31.9 in</td>\n<td>54 cm / 21.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 9-10 Years</td>\n<td>9-10</td>\n<td>31-37.5 kg / 68.3-82.7 lbs</td>\n<td>140-150 cm / 55.1-59.1 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>87 cm / 34.3 in</td>\n<td>83 cm / 32.7 in</td>\n<td>57 cm / 22.4 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother S</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>40-49 kg / 88.2-108.0 lbs</td>\n<td>155-160 cm / 61.0-63.0 in</td>\n<td>96 cm / 37.8 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>94 cm / 37.0 in</td>\n<td>64 cm / 25.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother M</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>49-60 kg / 108.0-132.3 lbs</td>\n<td>160-165 cm / 63.0-65.0 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>100 cm / 39.4 in</td>\n<td>66 cm / 26.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother L</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>60-67.5 kg / 132.3-148.8 lbs</td>\n<td>165-170 cm / 65.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>112 cm / 44.1 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>67.5-77.5 kg / 148.8-170.9 lbs</td>\n<td>170-175 cm / 66.9-68.9 in</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>71 cm / 28.0 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>116 cm / 45.7 in</td>\n<td>108 cm / 42.5 in</td>\n<td>71 cm / 28.0 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 2XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>77.5-85 kg / 170.9-187.4 lbs</td>\n<td>175-180 cm / 68.9-70.9 in</td>\n<td>114 cm / 44.9 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>112 cm / 44.1 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85-95 kg / 187.4-209.4 lbs</td>\n<td>175-188 cm / 68.9-74.0 in</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>124 cm / 48.8 in</td>\n<td>116 cm / 45.7 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother 4XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>95-105 kg / 209.4-231.5 lbs</td>\n<td>180-190 cm / 70.9-74.8 in</td>\n<td>122 cm / 48.0 in</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>128 cm / 50.4 in</td>\n<td>120 cm / 47.2 in</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Blush Tulle is made for the kind of matching moment that feels playful without being overdone. The black bodice keeps the look simple while the pale pink tulle skirt adds a soft party-ready finish for photos, celebrations, and sunny family plans.</p>\n\n<p>The size chart is the source of truth for every listed size. The baby, girl, and mother rows are separated by Type so each shopper can select the exact piece they need.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Coordinated pieces:</strong> Baby romper, girl dress, and mother dress options in one matching listing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Photo-ready contrast:</strong> Black sleeveless bodice with a blush layered tulle skirt.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Chart-backed sizing:</strong> Every variant maps to a row in the attached size chart.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Extended mother sizing:</strong> Adult rows run from S through 4XL.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only safety:</strong> Built unpublished for final image and merchandising review.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Select each Type and Size to build a coordinated blush tulle look for mom, baby, and daughter.</p>",
